[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l006","ordinal":121601,"en":"Such was the example set,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l007","ordinal":121602,"en":"Such was the entertainment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l008","ordinal":121603,"en":"Such were the deeds!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l009","ordinal":121604,"en":"You seven khans, to your own lands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l010","ordinal":121605,"en":"When you arrive, tell of it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l011","ordinal":121606,"en":"To the old men lying at home,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l012","ordinal":121607,"en":"To the children crawling about,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l013","ordinal":121608,"en":"Go and tell it for all to hear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l014","ordinal":121609,"en":"If this prize of mine is too small,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l015","ordinal":121610,"en":"Stake this garden of mine belonging to the treasury;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l016","ordinal":121611,"en":"Stake the golden throne I sit upon;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l017","ordinal":121612,"en":"Stake my Tajik people who work with hoes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l018","ordinal":121613,"en":"If this prize of mine is too small,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l019","ordinal":121614,"en":"Shave my beard and stake me, my people!’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l020","ordinal":121615,"en":"Thus he staked his gold lavishly"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l021","ordinal":121616,"en":"At that feast of Semetey's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l022","ordinal":121617,"en":"Staking both his livestock and himself."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l023","ordinal":121618,"en":"While he had the proclamation made,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l024","ordinal":121619,"en":"Töö the Wrestler came out from Kokand;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l025","ordinal":121620,"en":"Ak the Wrestler came out from Bukhara."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l026","ordinal":121621,"en":"They knew each other,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l027","ordinal":121622,"en":"But without a great feast"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l028","ordinal":121623,"en":"The wrestlers had been unable to meet."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l029","ordinal":121624,"en":"Then Ak the Wrestler of Bukhara"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l030","ordinal":121625,"en":"And Töö the Wrestler of Kokand"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l031","ordinal":121626,"en":"Wrestled each other on foot."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l032","ordinal":121627,"en":"They tore at each other like hungry wolves,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l033","ordinal":121628,"en":"Wrestling mercilessly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l034","ordinal":121629,"en":"They snapped at each other like hungry bull camels,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l035","ordinal":121630,"en":"Grappling without sparing themselves,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l036","ordinal":121631,"en":"Tearing at each other's trouser legs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l037","ordinal":121632,"en":"For eight days"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l038","ordinal":121633,"en":"Neither wrestler could throw the other."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b003:l039","ordinal":121634,"en":"They tore at whatever part they could see,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l001","ordinal":121635,"en":"Butting like gray rams."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l002","ordinal":121636,"en":"The wrestlers' struggle"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l003","ordinal":121637,"en":"Had lasted nine days"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l004","ordinal":121638,"en":"When Bukhara's Ak the Wrestler"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l005","ordinal":121639,"en":"Lost his strength."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l006","ordinal":121640,"en":"Töö the Wrestler of Kokand"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l007","ordinal":121641,"en":"Lifted him and hurled him down,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l008","ordinal":121642,"en":"The many treasures and staked livestock—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l009","ordinal":121643,"en":"He seized them all."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l010","ordinal":121644,"en":"Seeing this, Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l011","ordinal":121645,"en":"The fierce hero, burned with anguish."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l012","ordinal":121646,"en":"‘A man of Kokand, over a man of Bukhara—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l013","ordinal":121647,"en":"How can he win?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l014","ordinal":121648,"en":"Töö the Wrestler, over this Ak the Wrestler—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l015","ordinal":121649,"en":"How can he throw him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l016","ordinal":121650,"en":"That these people of Bukhara"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l017","ordinal":121651,"en":"Should be humiliated—what does that mean?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l018","ordinal":121652,"en":"The honour lost is mine;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l019","ordinal":121653,"en":"Whose is the honour gained?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l020","ordinal":121654,"en":"May I sink away unborn!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l021","ordinal":121655,"en":"If I let this honour be lost,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l022","ordinal":121656,"en":"Let me die rather than go on living."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l023","ordinal":121657,"en":"To have my honour taken—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l024","ordinal":121658,"en":"Rather than this, my wretched soul,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l025","ordinal":121659,"en":"May I sink away unborn!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l026","ordinal":121660,"en":"This golden throne here,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l027","ordinal":121661,"en":"I shall stake it as a prize"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l028","ordinal":121662,"en":"And try my hand at wrestling."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l029","ordinal":121663,"en":"If the wrestler throws me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l030","ordinal":121664,"en":"I shall give him my golden throne."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l031","ordinal":121665,"en":"If I throw the wrestler,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l032","ordinal":121666,"en":"I shall seize him and split his head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l033","ordinal":121667,"en":"And tear his ribs apart."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l034","ordinal":121668,"en":"When my days are done, let me die."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l035","ordinal":121669,"en":"With this wrestler who thinks himself strong,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l036","ordinal":121670,"en":"Let me try a wrestling bout!’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l037","ordinal":121671,"en":"Thus he spoke these words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l038","ordinal":121672,"en":"And from atop the golden throne"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0588:b004:l039","ordinal":121673,"en":"He roared fiercely,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l001","ordinal":121674,"en":"Then he called to Camel Wrestler:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l002","ordinal":121675,"en":"“My wrestler, turn your head this way!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l003","ordinal":121676,"en":"My age has reached twelve;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l004","ordinal":121677,"en":"I will wrestle, wrestler—wait."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l005","ordinal":121678,"en":"Go away sated with abundant spoils;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l006","ordinal":121679,"en":"I have staked my city of Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l007","ordinal":121680,"en":"Take away my subject people!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l008","ordinal":121681,"en":"Turn your horse's head;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l009","ordinal":121682,"en":"If you are a lion, my wrestler,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l010","ordinal":121683,"en":"Let us grapple once."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l011","ordinal":121684,"en":"Stand in the place ahead!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l012","ordinal":121685,"en":"Saying this, Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l013","ordinal":121686,"en":"Bending his knees toward the ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l014","ordinal":121687,"en":"From atop the golden throne"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l015","ordinal":121688,"en":"The boy ran down at a rush."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l016","ordinal":121689,"en":"Your father's grave, Camel Wrestler!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l017","ordinal":121690,"en":"Swollen with pride after throwing his opponent,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l018","ordinal":121691,"en":"Raging, looming large,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l019","ordinal":121692,"en":"His nose bulging like a leather sack:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l020","ordinal":121693,"en":"“This wretched child,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l021","ordinal":121694,"en":"Let me seize him now;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l022","ordinal":121695,"en":"Let me seize him and dash him to the ground."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l023","ordinal":121696,"en":"His age has reached twelve;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l024","ordinal":121697,"en":"Let me knock his madness far away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l025","ordinal":121698,"en":"If God grants it, the golden throne"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l026","ordinal":121699,"en":"Let me seize and mount."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l027","ordinal":121700,"en":"His age has reached twelve;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l028","ordinal":121701,"en":"Let me bring all my strength upon the wretch."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l029","ordinal":121702,"en":"The golden throne beneath him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l030","ordinal":121703,"en":"Let me take it from the boy like this.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l031","ordinal":121704,"en":"Camel Wrestler stood waiting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l032","ordinal":121705,"en":"The twelve-year-old scourge"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l033","ordinal":121706,"en":"Ismail then intercepted."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l034","ordinal":121707,"en":"Then Ismail stood and said:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l036","ordinal":121708,"en":"“My child, you have not yet reached twelve;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l037","ordinal":121709,"en":"Your time to wrestle has not yet come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l038","ordinal":121710,"en":"You have not reached fifteen;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b003:l039","ordinal":121711,"en":"Your mother's white milk"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l001","ordinal":121712,"en":"Has not yet left your palate."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l002","ordinal":121713,"en":"A khan does not wrestle in a bout."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l003","ordinal":121714,"en":"What are you doing, my son, what are you doing?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l004","ordinal":121715,"en":"A khan does not wrestle for a prize.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l005","ordinal":121716,"en":"Saying this, Ismail"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l006","ordinal":121717,"en":"Now held the boy back."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l007","ordinal":121718,"en":"Then the boy said this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l008","ordinal":121719,"en":"Spoke shocking words no one had heard:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l009","ordinal":121720,"en":"“Alas, father, let me go!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l010","ordinal":121721,"en":"Whose honor has been won?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l011","ordinal":121722,"en":"Whose honor has been lost?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l012","ordinal":121723,"en":"Those whose support was like iron,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l013","ordinal":121724,"en":"The Bukharans' countless prizes—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l014","ordinal":121725,"en":"The Kokand men looted them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l015","ordinal":121726,"en":"I will not let it be said they took them all!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l016","ordinal":121727,"en":"My age has reached twelve;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l017","ordinal":121728,"en":"If my death has come, I shall die."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l018","ordinal":121729,"en":"With Kokand's Camel Wrestler"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l019","ordinal":121730,"en":"I shall try a bout of wrestling."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l020","ordinal":121731,"en":"If I throw the wrestler,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l021","ordinal":121732,"en":"I shall attain my wish;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l022","ordinal":121733,"en":"If the wrestler throws me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l023","ordinal":121734,"en":"I shall depart in my youth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l024","ordinal":121735,"en":"Father, one without fervor has no faith;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l025","ordinal":121736,"en":"One without honor has no dignity."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l026","ordinal":121737,"en":"Letting my honor be taken,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l027","ordinal":121738,"en":"Father, should God strike me down?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l028","ordinal":121739,"en":"‘Stop, you are twelve,’ you say;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l029","ordinal":121740,"en":"Father, should God strike you down instead?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l030","ordinal":121741,"en":"Offering advice without reason,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l031","ordinal":121742,"en":"You seem to get ahead of yourself."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l032","ordinal":121743,"en":"How many people from death,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l033","ordinal":121744,"en":"Father, can you hold back?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l034","ordinal":121745,"en":"Father, like a black-eyed ram,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l036","ordinal":121746,"en":"Like a male black crow,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l038","ordinal":121747,"en":"You have no honor, no dignity;","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0589:b004:l039","ordinal":121748,"en":"You are a foolish man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l001","ordinal":121749,"en":"“Alas, father, let me go!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l002","ordinal":121750,"en":"When God Most High, the Almighty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l003","ordinal":121751,"en":"Gives His mighty command,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l004","ordinal":121752,"en":"Azrael, the taker of souls,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l005","ordinal":121753,"en":"When he stretches out his five hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l006","ordinal":121754,"en":"‘Of the mortal God Most High created,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l007","ordinal":121755,"en":"Take the soul,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l008","ordinal":121756,"en":"When He gives His firm command,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l009","ordinal":121757,"en":"Man's speaking tongue is bound."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l010","ordinal":121758,"en":"From this deceitful world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l011","ordinal":121759,"en":"When the Almighty commands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l012","ordinal":121760,"en":"What soul can flee and escape?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l013","ordinal":121761,"en":"Will the dug grave not take us in,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l014","ordinal":121762,"en":"The eighteen thousand worlds"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l015","ordinal":121763,"en":"The dark earth that obliterates?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l016","ordinal":121764,"en":"Father, you are a worthless man,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l017","ordinal":121765,"en":"Without reason you think yourself so capable;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l018","ordinal":121766,"en":"You are a good-for-nothing man!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l019","ordinal":121767,"en":"His father Ismail,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l020","ordinal":121768,"en":"Saying this, Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l021","ordinal":121769,"en":"Struck him squarely on the cheek,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l022","ordinal":121770,"en":"Pushed him off to the side."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l023","ordinal":121771,"en":"Tumbling like a feedbag,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l024","ordinal":121772,"en":"Ismail fell."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l025","ordinal":121773,"en":"Struck by the back of his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l026","ordinal":121774,"en":"Ismail sprawled on the ground."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l027","ordinal":121775,"en":"Without sorrow the boy shouted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l028","ordinal":121776,"en":"Calling Camel Wrestler."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l029","ordinal":121777,"en":"At the sight of Camel Wrestler,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l030","ordinal":121778,"en":"His whole body bristled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l031","ordinal":121779,"en":"Camel Wrestler stood ready,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l032","ordinal":121780,"en":"Roaring like a lion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l033","ordinal":121781,"en":"To the wrestler who had braced himself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l034","ordinal":121782,"en":"Your orphan, Manas's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l035","ordinal":121783,"en":"Came close."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l036","ordinal":121784,"en":"“Your father's grave, Camel Wrestler!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l037","ordinal":121785,"en":"Make your promise firm;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l038","ordinal":121786,"en":"Swear an oath binding unto death!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b003:l039","ordinal":121787,"en":"My wrestler, if I fall, I shall give"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l001","ordinal":121788,"en":"The golden crown I wear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l002","ordinal":121789,"en":"The golden throne I sit upon."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l003","ordinal":121790,"en":"I have staked them all, Camel Wrestler."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l004","ordinal":121791,"en":"If you throw me and win,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l005","ordinal":121792,"en":"This Bukhara with its city,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l006","ordinal":121793,"en":"My grain-growing lands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l007","ordinal":121794,"en":"I have staked them too, Camel Wrestler,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l008","ordinal":121795,"en":"My hoe-working Tajik people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l009","ordinal":121796,"en":"If I fall, I shall give my golden throne."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l011","ordinal":121797,"en":"If you fall, Camel Wrestler,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l012","ordinal":121798,"en":"Will you stake your blood?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l013","ordinal":121799,"en":"I have staked my city of Bukhara;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l014","ordinal":121800,"en":"Will you stake your life?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l015","ordinal":121801,"en":"If I throw you and win,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l016","ordinal":121802,"en":"I shall send word to my people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l017","ordinal":121803,"en":"Without letting you utter another excuse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l018","ordinal":121804,"en":"I shall tear off your head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l019","ordinal":121805,"en":"If you throw me and win,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l020","ordinal":121806,"en":"I shall send word to my people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l021","ordinal":121807,"en":"Here in this Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l022","ordinal":121808,"en":"Placing my golden crown upon you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l023","ordinal":121809,"en":"Seating you upon the golden throne,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l024","ordinal":121810,"en":"I shall raise you as khan.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l025","ordinal":121811,"en":"After he had said this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l026","ordinal":121812,"en":"Proud of having thrown his opponent,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l027","ordinal":121813,"en":"Camel Wrestler came forward smoothly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l028","ordinal":121814,"en":"“Agreed, agreed, agreed!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l029","ordinal":121815,"en":"Agreed, good, hero!” he said,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l030","ordinal":121816,"en":"Bracing himself in anger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l031","ordinal":121817,"en":"And charged at the boy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l032","ordinal":121818,"en":"“Your father's grave, Camel Wrestler!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l033","ordinal":121819,"en":"Take whatever hold you like, wrestler;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l034","ordinal":121820,"en":"Bring your great strength to bear, wrestler."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l035","ordinal":121821,"en":"If you hold back, take your own mother, wrestler!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l036","ordinal":121822,"en":"Bring your utmost strength, wrestler;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l037","ordinal":121823,"en":"Leave yourself no regret, wrestler!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l038","ordinal":121824,"en":"One of the seven days is death;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0590:b004:l039","ordinal":121825,"en":"When we both die,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l001","ordinal":121826,"en":"My wrestler, when you see the face of the other world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l002","ordinal":121827,"en":"On the night of intercession,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l003","ordinal":121828,"en":"On the day of the Last Judgment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l004","ordinal":121829,"en":"Lest things go badly, my wrestler,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l005","ordinal":121830,"en":"May God not strike you down!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l006","ordinal":121831,"en":"Seizing me by the collar in that straitened place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l007","ordinal":121832,"en":"Do not demand payment for your blood."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l008","ordinal":121833,"en":"When you go to the other world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l009","ordinal":121834,"en":"Do not say, ‘He used his prowess;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l010","ordinal":121835,"en":"That child was too much for me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l011","ordinal":121836,"en":"He used his lion's might.’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l012","ordinal":121837,"en":"‘Semetey was strong,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l013","ordinal":121838,"en":"He resorted to strength,’ do not say."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l014","ordinal":121839,"en":"Take whatever hold you like, wrestler;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l015","ordinal":121840,"en":"Trip me however you like, wrestler!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l016","ordinal":121841,"en":"Saying this, Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l017","ordinal":121842,"en":"Stood ready for the wrestler."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l018","ordinal":121843,"en":"The wrestler saw him standing there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l019","ordinal":121844,"en":"His knees bent toward the ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l020","ordinal":121845,"en":"Running in anger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l021","ordinal":121846,"en":"Camel Wrestler reached him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l022","ordinal":121847,"en":"Camel Wrestler's prowess"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l023","ordinal":121848,"en":"The orphan Semetey now saw."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l024","ordinal":121849,"en":"To the furious wrestler"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l025","ordinal":121850,"en":"Semetey held out his forearm."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l026","ordinal":121851,"en":"The wrestler seized his forearm,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l027","ordinal":121852,"en":"Applied all his strength."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l028","ordinal":121853,"en":"As the wrestler gripped him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l029","ordinal":121854,"en":"He hummed disdainfully, paying no heed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l030","ordinal":121855,"en":"That wrestler's grip"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0591:b003:l031","ordinal":121856,"en":"Semetey valued less than a scrap of hide."}]
